    <statement><p>Calculate the linear combination:
<m>2 \left\lt -5,-1,-1\right&gt; + 3 \left\lt -2,4,-2\right&gt;</m>  = <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;-16,10,-8\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>2 \left\lt -5,-1,-1\right&gt; + 3 \left\lt -2,4,-2\right&gt;</m> 


<m>\quad = \left\lt  2 (-5) + 3 (-2), 2 (-1) + 3 (4), 2 (-1) + 3 (-2) \right&gt;</m> 


<m>\quad = \left\lt -16,10,-8\right&gt;</m>


</solution>
